# ThermalManager Supporting FBs

## 1. ThermalTimer_FB_ST
Purpose: Run Thermaler for a fixed duration or until setpoint reached.
Inputs: Cycle_Active, Mix_Complete
Outputs: ThermalTimer_Done
Logic: TON timer instance, starts when Mix_Complete is TRUE.

## 2. ThermalAlarm_FB_ST
Purpose: Raise alarm if temperature exceeds safety threshold.
Inputs: Tn_Temp_Value, Tn_Temp_Max
Outputs: Thermal_Alarm
Logic: IF Tn_Temp_Value > Tn_Temp_Max THEN Thermal_Alarm := TRUE.

## 3. ThermalInterlock_FB_ST
Purpose: Prevent Thermaler from energizing if pump or mixer is running.
Inputs: Pump_Discharge, Mixer_Motor
Outputs: Thermal_Enable
Logic: Thermal_Enable := NOT(Pump_Discharge OR Mixer_Motor).
